# Exclude the models dir, but keep the pre-downloaded essentia model cache so the
# image ships with it -- otherwise every fresh HF replica re-downloads ~35 MB of
# .pb files from essentia.upf.edu on its first request (and again after any
# replica restart, since the disk cache is ephemeral).
